WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.410
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind how to start a computer

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:05.811
safely.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.549
Adult guidance: helps children learn safe routines. Power button: starts or shuts

00:00:11.549 --> 00:00:12.782
down a computer.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:18.712
Clean dry hands: help protect electronic devices. Gentle touch: protects screens and

00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:22.534
keys. Save work: keeps a digital file for later.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:28.349
Create a class safety demonstration. Show a good example of adult guidance and power

00:00:28.349 --> 00:00:31.196
button and explain why the good practice matters.
